{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"removal_events is the removal ledger beyond removed_at: every removal of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this node and every undo that cancelled one, except removed_at itself."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"An actor’s events alternate in ticket order, a removal then the undo"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cancelling it, so each is told apart by its place. Empty when removed_at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"says it all. A piece recreated after GC records a stand-in removal by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"undoing actor at lamport 0, then its cancel. The pairing relies on an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"undo cancelling only its own actor’s removal; a change to that rule needs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a new field, not a new reading of this one."}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_TextNode"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"removalEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_TimeTicket","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Yorkie0A14_V1_TimeTicketV","text":"Yorkie_V1_TimeTicket","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_TextNode\/removalEvents"},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:6Yorkie0A12_V1_TextNodeV13removalEventsSayAA0a1_B11_TimeTicketVGvp","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"removalEvents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},